  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian Assistance</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Programme de d&#xe9;veloppement du titre II.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Programme de d&#xe9;veloppement du titre II.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A new 5 year resilience food security activity called harea, with the goal of increasing resilience and food security for extremely poor marginalized households in the grand south of Madagascar. Harea is based on the premise that, by sustainably enhancing productive livelihoods, improving capacities, and reducing risk, extremely poor and marginalized households will move out of extreme poverty and have increased food security and resilience to adapt and recover from disasters, climate shocks and chronic vulnerability. Harea will reach a total of 54,642 households with the graduation approach in southern Madagascar over the life of the activity.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">La fourniture d&apos;une protection efficace, d&apos;une assistance et de solutions durables aux r&#xe9;fugi&#xe9;s, aux personnes d&#xe9;plac&#xe9;es &#xe0; l&apos;int&#xe9;rieur de leur propre pays (PDI) et aux autres victimes de conflits et de catastrophes.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Programme de d&#xe9;veloppement Titre II &#xe0; travers un partenaire de l&apos;Agence am&#xe9;ricaine pour le d&#xe9;veloppement international.</narrative>
  </description>
